## Summary
The article announces the Coursera Connector for Claude, a new integration that embeds Coursera's trusted learning content directly into work workflows. This tool aims to enable skill building in real-time work contexts without disrupting productivity.

## Key Points
- The Coursera Connector for Claude is launched as a new integration.
- It brings Coursera's learning resources into the flow of work.
- The integration facilitates seamless skill development for employees during their daily tasks.


